mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo></math>?</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mfenced></math></p><p>Target Eq.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>Eq. ii&nbsp;- Eq. i</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>010</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>010</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>",
